      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"OpenERPSyncingConfig-Introduction\">Introduction</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">To sync the orders from OpenMRS to Odoo we need to configure the Order type shop mapping and units to be synced in Odoo.  Currently Bahmni supports syncing of the following order types:</span></p><ul><li><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Drug Order</span></li><li><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Lab Order</span></li><li><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Radiology Order</span></li></ul><h2 id=\"OpenERPSyncingConfig-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"8405ddbb-bbda-465a-8f6b-6738845a82cd\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Prerequisite</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The Shop should have already been created in Odoo.</p></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"e13cedf4-39c8-4195-a92b-3fa9923efc90\" data-macro-name=\"widget\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/q2fF-IOtcs8?wmode=opaque\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 300px\" type=\"text/html\">\n</iframe>\n    \n</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Video Walkthrough</span></strong></p><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Login to Odoo and navigate to &quot;Sales&quot; tab. Under configuration click on &quot;Order Type - Shop mapping&quot;.</span></strong></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114627969/image2017-2-13_14-55-30.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978472307&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=451\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114627969/image2017-2-13_14-55-30.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978472307&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114627850\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-2-13_14-55-30.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114627969\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"7d680e1b-e155-4bad-a7fc-f1994c2a0abd\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114627969/image2017-2-13_14-55-30.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978472307&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1068&amp;height=804 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114627969/image2017-2-13_14-55-30.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978472307&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=451 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Order type - shop mapping</strong></span></p><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">2. Click on &quot;Create&quot; button to create a new mapping. Keep the &quot;Local Shop&quot;  and &quot;Location Name&quot; as blank.</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"Drug order mapping\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114627969/image2017-2-13_14-57-54.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978471737&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=262\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114627969/image2017-2-13_14-57-54.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978471737&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114627894\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-2-13_14-57-54.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114627969\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"bc111b34-81ff-4045-95fc-f997ee70c73a\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Drug order mapping\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114627969/image2017-2-13_14-57-54.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978471737&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=524 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114627969/image2017-2-13_14-57-54.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978471737&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=262 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Drug Order and Pharmacy shop mapping.</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">3. Similar to the above create the mapping for Lab and Radiology orders.</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114627969/image2017-2-13_15-2-14.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978470763&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=314\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114627969/image2017-2-13_15-2-14.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978470763&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114627940\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-2-13_15-2-14.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114627969\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"210620b5-a725-4bfe-a57a-0a3226296375\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114627969/image2017-2-13_15-2-14.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978470763&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=628 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114627969/image2017-2-13_15-2-14.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1486978470763&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=314 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"text-align: center;\">Drug Order, Lab Order and Radiology order mapping</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">4. To configure the Units of measure click on the option &quot;Units to be synced&quot;.</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.ne